      "typical_award_size": "$49 million revolving fund ($10 million MTC plus $39 million CDFI capital). Note A senior up to 85% LTV at lender rate; Note B subordinate (MTC capital) fixed at no more than 2% with a minimum 3:1 leverage; Note C first-loss at 0% with no payments and possible forgiveness if affordability is maintained; maximum program exposure $2,500,000 per borrower outstanding for Notes B and C; maximum 10-year term, no prepayment penalty; origination the greater of $30,000 or 1% of total loans. Two Oakland loans closed preserving 71 homes.",
